# Architecture Map

Mappa di riferimento:

- Source legacy: `@.agent/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- Guide cross-platform: `@.agent/CROSS_PLATFORM_ARCHITECTURE.md`

Traduzione operativa:
- `agents/` -> `.cursor/agents/` (subagents Cursor)
- `skills/` -> `.cursor/skills/` (junction verso `.agent/skills/`)
- `workflows/` -> `.cursor/commands/`
- `rules/` -> `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`
- `memory/` -> regola always-on + `AGENTS.md`

Mantieni `.agent/` intatta per retrocompatibilita con Antigravity IDE.
